WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.010
‎This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:41.810
Suirei.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:49.230
At least keep the rats under control.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:50.820
I'm terribly sorry.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:52.610
Oh?

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.910
I've seen this child before.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.160
Lady Shenmei.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.660
I apologize.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.210
He is Shirou's child.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.290
Just a child's prank.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.300
Come on, let's go.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:14.930
Mother.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.050
Loulan.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:22.220
I knew it!

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:26.770
Well, then, whip this girl.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:30.150
A hundred lashes should be enough.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.820
Prepare a pillar to tie her to.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.240
Lady Shenmei, please.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.330
This is bad.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:43.660
That woman's dangerous. I sneaked in

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.420
and saw the Feifa.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.630
They'll claim it's punishment
and get rid of me.

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.290
Hurry up.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.380
Mother,

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:54.010
remember what you said before?

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.430
That you wanted a new apothecary?

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:58.090
This girl is it.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.720
She doesn't look like one.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:07.560
True, but she's over 30.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.480
By constantly testing her own medicines,

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.490
she's made her body stop aging.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.490
Oh?

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:19.280
I do not know which medicine works,

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:22.870
but she may be able to
create an elixir of immortality.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.000
If she fails,
she'll die like the man before her.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.630
An elixir of immortality?
The man before her?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.130
Well, if that's the case, then fine.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.380
Lady Ayla,
we'll continue this conversation later.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.090
Yeah.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:42.970
Oh, right.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.480
She won't be able to work here properly, right?

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.730
Take the apothecary with us,

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.650
to our "Fortress."

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.450
So Shisui's true identity was

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.410
Consort Loulan.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.580
What an actress.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.580
No, more like a tanuki.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.040
When I gave special lessons
to the four ladies,

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:14.300
she sat there
in flashy clothes, expressionless.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.130
She avoided the Empress Dowager

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:20.090
and didn't get near
Consort Lishu in the bath,

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.850
probably so no one would realize
she was Consort Loulan.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.850
She did not hide from me,

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.100
because when I caught Maomao,

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.400
I didn't recognize her as Consort Loulan.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.440
I had a vague feeling though.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:38.240
She liked bugs, was a little odd,

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.240
and gossiped like any normal girl.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:46.700
Turns out I was completely fooled.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:51.840
Episode 44: Fortress

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.300
This was the room
used by the previous apothecary.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.930
I didn't plan to bring you this far.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:08.470
Is Shisui

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.270
your half-sister?

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:16.820
She's the only one
who treats me like a sister.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:17.860
I thought so.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:22.280
I heard Loulan was
Lord Shishou's only daughter,

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.370
but if there was a second daughter
from another mother,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.950
then someone
as terrifying as Lady Shenmei,

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.870
would never approve of her existence.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:35.960
Lady Shenmei absolutely despises me.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.250
My father, Shishou,

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.840
was just a branch member
of the Shi family.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.550
But due to his talents,

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:47.560
he was adopted into the main family,
Lady Shenmei's family.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.600
That's when he was given
the name "Shishou,"

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.440
and the two got engaged.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.850
But during the previous emperor's reign,

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.440
Lady Shenmei was summoned
to the rear palace.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:01.240
When she returned years later,
supposedly as a gift,

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.990
my mother and I
were already at my father's side.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:09.530
She kicked us out of the house

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.580
and made us work as servants.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.410
She even hated the fact

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:18.250
that my name included a character
from the Shi family.

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:21.170
Wait, then "Shisui".

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.550
Yeah. That used to be my name.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.430
Seems like Loulan really liked that name.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:31.260
If she was going to use
a fake name as a maid,

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.890
she could have picked something else.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.360
That's just how she is.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:44.360
Born from the same father
but different mothers.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:50.240
One raised like a flower,
offered to the emperor.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.740
The other,

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.870
sent to the rear palace
as just a handmaid,

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.210
moving in the shadows.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.460
Suirei was involved in
the attempted assassination of Lord Jinshi

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.210
at the middle shrine.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.050
She used the chaos
of the warehouse explosion

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.550
to steal the ritual tools,

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:11.220
and when it was discovered,
she faked her death and escaped.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.600
And the recent Feifa attack...

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.690
Lord Shishou was probably behind that too.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.570
Lord Jinshi, the palace administrator,

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.570
was trying to reform the rear palace.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.610
Going against Lord Shishou's way.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.820
But is that all?

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:34.080
Shisui. No,

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.370
Loulan mentioned that hairpin
being valuable.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.250
He's not just an official.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:41.380
Not even a eunuch.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:43.170
What's wrong?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.130
When you disguised yourself as an eunuch
to enter the rear palace,

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.760
how were you inspected?

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.600
What? Out of nowhere.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:54.890
It was a physical check.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.480
For a man who's not castrated to enter?

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.190
Three officials perform a physical exam.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.190
It's hard to fake it.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.900
Then how did Lord Jinshi get in?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.200
The only men who can freely come
and go in the rear palace are

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.370
the emperor or his close relatives.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.870
The only man close to the emperor
is his younger brother

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.580
No, I thought about that possibility,

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.920
but the ages do not match.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:24.960
Still, those childish moments of his,

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.420
if that's his real self

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.430
Now that I think of it,

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:35.470
during the hunt,
he tried to tell me something important.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.640
Ox bezoar can drive people mad.

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.270
How terrifying.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.520
What's wrong?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.060
Nothing.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.740
All right, let's set this aside for now.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.740
First, we need to assess the situation.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.450
Snow.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:59.160
Yeah, it's just
beginning to fall in earnest.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.920
In the north, the highlands?

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.960
Shenmei called it a "Fortress."

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.800
Surrounded by thick walls
and backed by a cliff.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.800
Why would Shenmei be here?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.050
Lord Gaoshun suspected the envoy had
snuck out of the inn

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:19.060
and was dealing with someone.

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:24.310
Those Western weapons
made in the workshop, the Feifa.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:28.320
Are you planning to start a war?

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.620
That's not my decision to make.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.910
But since Lady Loulan said that,

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.170
go ahead and pretend
to mix some medicines.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.750
I was going to anyway.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.340
I will bring you meals.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.170
Just make sure not to upset Lady Shenmei.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:59.430
War, huh. That's bold.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.680
Now, what do I do?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.140
We're on the third floor.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.730
It's snowing outside,

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.650
and even if I escape, I might
collapse before reaching a village.

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:13.820
Was the last apothecary
confined like this too?

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.370
Supposedly died while testing medicines.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.080
Oh? Whoa!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.830
A treasure trove
left by the previous apothecary?

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:36.640
It must be the post-harvest season by now.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.390
I remember

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:41.810
hearing wars happen
when farmers have free time.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.940
If this is the northern Shihoku province...

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.810
Ten days by boat from the rear palace,

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:51.980
then walking to the hot springs,
then by carriage.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:54.950
There's only one mountainous region
within that range.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:59.120
I should've studied more.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:02.950
Young master, do not play over there!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.580
Eh,

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.880
but I haven't finished
exploring that part yet!

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:12.090
So there's another child besides Kyou-u.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.420
When we were brought here
from the village,

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.930
Suirei looked reluctant

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:21.050
when Kyou-u insisted on coming.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:23.930
Maybe she really wanted to
leave him behind.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.980
If the Shi clan starts a rebellion,

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.940
the whole family will be punished.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:36.200
Even the women, the children, the babies.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.950
Do the children know that?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.290
Have the adults told them?

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.960
I wish I could think of it
as someone else's problem.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.840
Mother is smiling.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.350
This is where I'm supposed to smile.

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.390
When Mother was mad at Father,

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.110
I was supposed to be mad too.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:13.900
When she was punishing someone,

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.900
I was supposed to just watch.
That's how I learned to act.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:22.830
When Mother smiled, I smiled.
When she grieved, I grieved.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:27.040
If I stayed a doll,
Mother would not get angry.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.460
She would not become any uglier.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:32.250
I felt trapped and suffocated,

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.420
but I thought that was fine.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.670
But then.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.510
Filthy!

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.930
You and that woman!

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.720
You should never have been born!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.890
I was wrong.

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.600
Mother just kept getting uglier.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:53.690
Even staying a doll could not stop her.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:01.610
It was all for nothing.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:04.620
By the time I realized that,

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.620
everything was already too late.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:14.630
Hey.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.050
Lady Shenmei is calling.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.130
I've brought the apothecary.

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.640
Excuse me.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.640
The smell of musk.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.110
Something's been mixed in.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:38.980
So?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.410
Is the elixir of immortality ready yet?

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:48.700
It still needs a bit more time.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.580
Oh, I see.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.670
In here, it feels like
they're mistress and servant.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.380
Even though they usually
seem like close sisters.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:00.010
Make sure you have results by tomorrow.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.470
Understood.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.600
Let's go.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.600
I'm only allowed out of the room
once a day,

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.310
during these reports.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.940
I hate the situation I'm in,

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:16.690
but not the work itself.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.610
Most of the medicines are old,

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.650
but the selection is as good
as what the medical office had.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:24.950
Tons of research materials too.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.700
Whoever the last apothecary was,
they must have been incredibly skilled.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.200
Hey, apothecary.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.580
Yes, Lord Kyou-u?

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.420
Ugh, gross!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.960
- Ouch.
- Ugh, I want to punch him.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.420
Who's that?

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.970
The new apothecary.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:48.970
Hey, was there another woman
in Lady Shenmei's room?

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:50.930
Yes, there was.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.730
Really? My mother's supposed to be there.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.690
Did she seem well?

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.650
Kyou-u's mother.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.440
In there.

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:05.860
I could not say for sure,
I do not know which one she was.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.360
I see.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.570
That can't be helped.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:12.240
Mother's supposed to be busy with work.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:15.080
Maybe I should've just
waited back home after all.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.170
Was he sent to the hot springs

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.420
to keep him from meeting his mother?

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:23.260
Or, was it his mother herself.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.880
Well then, I'll be going.

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:30.850
Ah, hey.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.730
Never mind!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.870
So that's how it is, Lahan.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:56.750
Yes, it is just a hypothesis
based on the numbers, but

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:01.500
The northern fortress governed by Shishou
is being expanded.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.460
Yes.
It was originally an abandoned fortress.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:09.300
No paperwork has been filed
for the expansion.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.590
In other words,

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.350
rebellion.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:17.430
Even if the Shi clan has served
since the Wang Mu's era,

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:20.230
and even if Shishou was once
the empress regnant's favorite,

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.310
it is still inexcusable.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.360
How far along is it?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.860
Judging by when iron prices
started rising,

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:31.530
I believe preparations are well underway.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.280
We must act quickly.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.290
What are you doing,

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.950
Lahan?

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:40.290
F-Father.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.170
General.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:46.880
It is not proper to visit someone
of that rank so often.

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:49.590
It invites strange rumors.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.720
Especially when

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:57.310
the person in question
does not appear to be male or female.

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:59.100
- How dare you!
- Basen!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.140
But Father!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.600
Lord Gaoshun.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.900
I understand what the General
is trying to say.

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:11.900
The fault lies in my own inadequacy.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.530
Precisely.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.370
Considering how much he dotes
on his daughter,

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.710
I suppose I'm lucky this confrontation
didn't come sooner.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:21.750
The hidden passage,

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:24.290
the missing eunuch,

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.880
the nonexistent maid "Shisui."

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.970
I was always a step behind.

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:33.220
And in the end, Maomao was taken.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.890
That is my failure.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:39.720
Despite someone being able to move freely

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:41.480
between the inner and outer palace,

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.190
my daughter was abducted.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:46.730
And that someone

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:50.150
just sits leisurely
surrounded by paperwork.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.610
Are you saying

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:55.780
the fate of one woman
does not matter to you?

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.040
If that is sarcasm, I will accept it.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.660
But the true enemy is not me.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.660
It is Shishou.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.630
If you understand that much,

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:09.300
then what are you doing?

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.880
Huh!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.090
The General sees right through me.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.470
That I lack confidence in my true role,

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:23.730
that I ran away from it,
and now sit comfortably in this position.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.770
Half-hearted appearance,

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.270
half-hearted work.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.860
Do you really think
things will go well like that?

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:41.120
Remaining an irresponsible damn eunuch.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:43.750
What do you think
you can accomplish like that?

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.550
I...

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.760
Now, now. That was harsh.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.560
Uncle?

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:12.360
I never thought you saw me that way.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:16.990
I did not choose to become
a eunuch for fun, you know.

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.030
No! That is not what I meant at all!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.780
I was not talking about you, Uncle!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.620
I am an irresponsible eunuch.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.080
I can barely walk properly.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:30.540
I even had the luxury of
being carried here in a litter.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.670
I share the blame for what happened,

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:38.220
because I failed to keep proper watch
over Maomao.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.550
That's not true!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.680
I'm not blaming you at all, Uncle!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.440
We made it in time.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:50.810
When you get angry,
you get aggressive fast.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:54.280
But it is important to act
with an awareness

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.820
of the other person's circumstances.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.950
I know, Uncle.

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:00.700
That was just
a heat-of-the-moment exchange.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:04.160
I never really meant what I said.

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.910
I was not exactly exchanging
harsh words, though.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.540
Before it turns into a real fight,

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:14.840
shouldn't you express what you really want
to say, and do it properly, with respect?

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.040
I have come to make a request!

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:52.000
To defeat the traitor, Shishou,

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.960
I ask that the army be mobilized!

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.140
It appears the Shi clan

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.180
has been manufacturing a new type of Feifa
for the past few years.

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:11.900
There was an attempted assassination
using one,

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:15.110
and also the matter of Loulan's escape.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:17.990
We already have sufficient proof
of treason.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.570
The rot should be cut out
before it spreads.

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:27.080
This is not an appeal
to Jinshi the eunuch.

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:31.830
If Shishou is to be punished for treason
against the nation,

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:34.330
then it falls to the Imperial Guard,

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:38.050
the Emperor's direct forces, to act.

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.090
LI

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:41.010
And the one to lead them

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.300
will not be General Lakan.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.140
How long?

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:50.600
How long do you intend to keep deceiving
everyone with that false persona?

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.850
Lord Jinshi.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.350
No.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.690
The Moon Prince.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.450
I always knew,

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.200
this day would come.

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:14.540
It seems the time has come
to make my decision.

00:23:46.040 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.760 --> 00:24:00.950
Next episode: The Toad Tray

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
